# ── Scratch / working notes ────────────────────────────────────────────
# Kept on disk for local reference, deliberately not part of the repo: these
# duplicated the manual, the documentation site or the changelog, so they drift
# out of date silently. See docs/changelog.md ("repository cleanup").
ASTRA.md
EVALUATION.md
PROJECT_EXPLAINED.md
VIDEO_EDITING.md
YOUTUBE_SCRIPT.md
documentation.md
ppt.md
problem.md
docs/ps-alignment-sentence-report.md
